    {
      "id": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/826564881749884928",
      "url": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/826564881749884928",
      "title": "My latest New Scientist cartoon ",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/ec5956ff5f365bf3c635660ee9b6e80e/47f9367e7e7fc068-c3/s640x960/00672da683fe7fc26c5ab25135ee9aa3f6b755d6.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"1017\" data-orig-width=\"1500\" alt=\"Title: Need staff for your lab? Close your eyes and stick a pin in the chart!  Image: The chart consists of 81 rectangles arranged in a 9 x 9 grid.  Down the side are these nine labels: Brilliant Eccentric Indolent Charming Mysterious Diligent Scheming Visionary Clumsy  Across the bottom are these nine jobs: Technician Lab cat Lead Scientist Graduate student Stranger Robot Child prodigy Janitor Emeritus professor \" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/ec5956ff5f365bf3c635660ee9b6e80e/47f9367e7e7fc068-c3/s75x75_c1/a27bc74e79e69503162327cf68ac669c4f13b062.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ec5956ff5f365bf3c635660ee9b6e80e/47f9367e7e7fc068-c3/s100x200/d8ccfc6997e07c378c7716af72397dbdf7eecfd5.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ec5956ff5f365bf3c635660ee9b6e80e/47f9367e7e7fc068-c3/s250x400/d112fcfb95fa2daae80ba462df79b96f6ae09701.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ec5956ff5f365bf3c635660ee9b6e80e/47f9367e7e7fc068-c3/s400x600/505670862ca5371d4d8f29c5628b017e235a6c89.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ec5956ff5f365bf3c635660ee9b6e80e/47f9367e7e7fc068-c3/s500x750/0b788fd200128b5c5d47afffdcc8bcea4b7856ab.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ec5956ff5f365bf3c635660ee9b6e80e/47f9367e7e7fc068-c3/s540x810/698e283dfb3292315458354b531f4aff5ad385de.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ec5956ff5f365bf3c635660ee9b6e80e/47f9367e7e7fc068-c3/s640x960/00672da683fe7fc26c5ab25135ee9aa3f6b755d6.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ec5956ff5f365bf3c635660ee9b6e80e/47f9367e7e7fc068-c3/s1280x1920/31f34861efe8017d129582b089d54bf32c6dbe17.jpg 1280w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ec5956ff5f365bf3c635660ee9b6e80e/47f9367e7e7fc068-c3/s2048x3072/685ecd8757d08bc04a24e987294c309537ffccaf.jpg 1500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\"/>"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/826453202014715904",
      "url": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/826453202014715904",
      "title": "My latest books cartoon for the Guardian ",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/15d54abc7ccf8655537db611d5dc253a/8a15a5c0010b58ff-f2/s640x960/5ce4f071808c3c8122571596df9b2afd233a9cef.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"832\" data-orig-width=\"1500\" alt=\"Two books talking  Younger book  &quot;What's happening?&quot; Older book  &quot;The wheel of life has turned, my child... Our time on the front table of the bookshop is over, and, like brave birds flying south for the winter, we summer books must journey back to the shelves.&quot;  Younger book &quot;But I like it here!&quot; Older book &quot;All things must pass. The beach reads table you knew is already gone. The time of autumn books is upon us.&quot;   Younger book &quot;Will we ever return?&quot;  Older book &quot;The cycle is eternal: the Christmas bestsellers and prize nominees will come and go, but people will always want something nice to read on holiday.&quot; \" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/15d54abc7ccf8655537db611d5dc253a/8a15a5c0010b58ff-f2/s75x75_c1/8842d2d981af12e2d5d2454b40b25ac182fed048.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/15d54abc7ccf8655537db611d5dc253a/8a15a5c0010b58ff-f2/s100x200/bec11f333d5f9a39fcfe1eb177c9b7b31ee60047.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/15d54abc7ccf8655537db611d5dc253a/8a15a5c0010b58ff-f2/s250x400/9f0a4b5a7d58b6953e4ab1eb463c4e457b579341.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/15d54abc7ccf8655537db611d5dc253a/8a15a5c0010b58ff-f2/s400x600/5db3e7b0a8fa693c74c52052e6fc9f602f6df630.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/15d54abc7ccf8655537db611d5dc253a/8a15a5c0010b58ff-f2/s500x750/102fc0d4430e06f76b6ed7a0d3291f58235b84fc.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/15d54abc7ccf8655537db611d5dc253a/8a15a5c0010b58ff-f2/s540x810/6d7ac86939d5d47f22c805cf2445ea665ede928c.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/15d54abc7ccf8655537db611d5dc253a/8a15a5c0010b58ff-f2/s640x960/5ce4f071808c3c8122571596df9b2afd233a9cef.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/15d54abc7ccf8655537db611d5dc253a/8a15a5c0010b58ff-f2/s1280x1920/7223a4ddb700a946821d8b10145ecf5356cd4162.jpg 1280w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/15d54abc7ccf8655537db611d5dc253a/8a15a5c0010b58ff-f2/s2048x3072/f6a0fd5d19c7aef64b9b97d8a5af2fe5f791e494.jpg 1500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\"/>"
